    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S3020\n\nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the local finance law, in relation to\nbonds and notes of the city of Yonkers\n\nPURPOSE:  Extender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on\nserial bonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2013 to June 30, 2014.\n\nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 Section 54.40 of the local finance law, as amended by\nchapter 72 of the laws of 2012, is amended to read as follows: Bonds\nand notes of the city of Yonkers, subject to the provisions of the New\nYork State Financial Emergency Act of 1984 for the city of Yonkers\nissued on or before June 30, 2014.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:  Extender law - this bill extends the marketing\nlimitation on serial bonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2013 to June\n30, 2014.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:  2012 - S.6460 - Extender Law - Chapter 72\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS: Undetermined at this time.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:  This act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
